      "area": "General",
      "position": 2,
      "content": "Most courses in this degree's listing are upper-division and are not reflected below. Section 2: Please consult with the French Undergraduate Advisor if there are any issues in completing the 12 units required in any of the content areas. Consult the CSULB Catalog for additional details.",
      "contentHtml": "<p><br></p><p>Most courses in this degree's listing are upper-division and are not reflected below.</p><p><br></p><p>Section 2: Please consult with the French Undergraduate Advisor if there are any issues in completing the 12 units required in any of the content areas.</p><p><br></p><p>Consult the <a href=\"https://csulb.catalog.acalog.com/preview_program.php?catoid=12&amp;poid=6338\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CSULB Catalog</a> for additional details.</p>"
